-- CPosEl1.seg (L8, posets): El of the universe is fibrant, part 1 (model.tex
-- §8.1: I is tiny, y X * I = y (X * [1])).  For a code F over y Z, the cart
-- of F.1 into El along the Yoneda code map k |-> F k (the fibre of El at
-- F k is that of F at k, up to k id = k); its derived maps (CCart) are the
-- maps of lines, strict-fibre elements and composites used to glue El's
-- compositions from F's (CGlueRC).  A line of codes l at Z gives F = l at
-- the generic point of Z * [1] and a point o over (l , a) (the generic line
-- with a read in F), with oio its image.
--
-- Quarry: seg/model PElL (ElP: Pv, ph, ps, G1), GElC (Yon.H1).

level a ;
open Base ;
open Prelude[a+] ;
open Paths[a+] ;
open Trees[a] ;
open Arith[a] ;
module W0 = V[a] ;
module V1 = V[a+] ;
open Cat[a] ;
open SmallCat[a].Objs[obV] ; open SmallCat[a].Homs[obV, homV] ;
open CPosC[a] ;
module PB = CPosInst[a].PB ;
module GPR = PB.GPre[a] ;
module L = PB.GPre[a+].PS ;
module LP = PB.GPre[a+] ;
module UU = PB.CUniv.Univ[PB.CFibCl.Cl, PB.CFibCl.clSub, PB.CFibCl.clSub-id, PB.CFibCl.clSub-o, PB.CFibCl.encCl] ;
module TE = LP.TyL[UU.UCtx, UU.EGen] ;
module FGU = PB.CLine[a+].FC[UU.UCtx] ;

yP (Z : Ob) : GPR.PS.PCtx = PB.GYon[a].yP Z ;

module YG = PB.CYonCart.YC[PB.CFibCl.Cl, PB.CFibCl.clSub, PB.CFibCl.clSub-id, PB.CFibCl.clSub-o, PB.CFibCl.encCl] ;
